WEBVTT

00:06.970 --> 00:12.310
To serve at your side once again, 
Your Highness, brings me great happiness.

00:12.700 --> 00:15.000
Yes, well, how is your wound healing?

00:15.820 --> 00:18.670
Even the scar from it is insignificant.

00:18.670 --> 00:21.340
It's all thanks to the young Lady Clorence.

00:26.360 --> 00:29.690
I can't return to being Your Highness's guard,

00:29.690 --> 00:32.040
but work within the castle 
should pose no problem.

00:33.180 --> 00:35.510
I see. I'm glad to hear it.

00:35.890 --> 00:37.640
More importantly, Your Highness,

00:37.640 --> 00:41.390
I hear that you've gone into town 
numerous times for inspections.

00:42.250 --> 00:43.820
Yes, I have.

00:43.820 --> 00:45.640
Has something caught your attention?

00:46.060 --> 00:48.300
No, it's not that.

00:48.770 --> 00:50.890
Wait, perhaps it <i>is</i> that?

00:51.330 --> 00:52.900
By which you mean...?

00:53.740 --> 00:58.410
Everything is all right. It isn't 
anything to worry any of you.

00:58.940 --> 01:03.050
But if you use your disguise 
ability too frequently,

01:03.050 --> 01:06.340
it will put a strain on both 
your body and the artifact.

01:12.380 --> 01:15.430
It's true that if I continue 
to use it as I have been,

01:15.430 --> 01:17.400
one day, I'll lose the ability to transform.

01:18.460 --> 01:19.570
It's Ren.

01:19.570 --> 01:20.370
Come in.

01:21.550 --> 01:22.860
Excuse the intrusion.

01:22.860 --> 01:24.880
Sir Randall!

01:24.880 --> 01:28.560
You're already back? Congratulations.

01:29.000 --> 01:32.670
Thank you. It's all thanks 
to your younger sister.

01:32.670 --> 01:33.770
She has my gratitude.

01:34.590 --> 01:36.960
My little sister has always 
been self-centered.

01:36.960 --> 01:39.650
By helping others, she's finally reached 
an average level of humanity.

01:40.080 --> 01:43.840
Even when a person has been awarded 
the Order of the Imperial Rose,

01:43.840 --> 01:46.280
an older brother can 
be quite scathing, I see.

01:47.060 --> 01:49.450
Is Lady Clorence doing well?

01:49.870 --> 01:53.760
Now that you mention it, 
she was unwell recently.

01:54.080 --> 01:54.800
What?

01:54.800 --> 01:56.390
And is she all right now?

01:57.720 --> 01:59.190
It isn't an issue.

03:49.890 --> 03:52.740
Lise!

03:54.650 --> 03:57.300
And just what might you be doing?

03:58.560 --> 04:00.570
Chris...

04:02.100 --> 04:04.260
Oh! Please give that back!

04:04.480 --> 04:06.010
No!

04:06.010 --> 04:09.020
Lise, you study too much. 
How many times have I told you that?

04:09.510 --> 04:10.760
But...

04:11.160 --> 04:14.560
In order to work one's hardest, 
one must play one's hardest.

04:14.560 --> 04:16.670
Yes, indeed. It's very important.

04:16.670 --> 04:19.640
In case you're wondering, I'm going 
into town today to have some fun.

04:20.070 --> 04:22.030
Now, you should follow my example.

04:23.540 --> 04:24.630
Right...

04:25.500 --> 04:28.850
No matter the circumstances, 
a change of pace is important.

04:28.850 --> 04:29.540
At the very least...

04:29.910 --> 04:32.060
go get some sunlight.

04:35.020 --> 04:38.470
<i>It's true that sunlight boosts 
the immune system, but...</i>

04:39.720 --> 04:41.360
<i>I want to study.</i>

04:41.360 --> 04:43.240
<i>If I fail the physician's exam...</i>

04:44.090 --> 04:46.150
<i>I won't be able to take it ever again.</i>

04:47.540 --> 04:52.520
<i>No. I've decided to live 
this life as a doctor, too.</i>

04:52.520 --> 04:54.790
<i>I won't give up on this desire.</i>

05:01.540 --> 05:03.250
Huh? Rose?

05:03.820 --> 05:07.070
You have today off, don't you? 
Is something wrong?

05:07.460 --> 05:10.200
O-Oh, yes. You're right.

05:10.200 --> 05:13.460
I just ended up coming 
here without realizing it.

05:14.650 --> 05:17.070
I think you might be working too hard, Rose.

05:17.070 --> 05:20.120
On your days off, you should forget 
about work and get some rest.

05:27.640 --> 05:29.650
<i>How embarrassing.</i>

05:29.650 --> 05:32.680
<i>Right! Today, I will have myself 
a proper change of pace.</i>

05:33.140 --> 05:35.390
<i>On days like this, I should 
eat something sweet and—</i>

05:42.590 --> 05:43.880
Lord Ron?

05:44.670 --> 05:47.810
I heard that you'd fallen ill. 
Are you well now?

05:47.810 --> 05:50.700
What? How do you know about that?

05:50.700 --> 05:52.530
I heard from someone else.

05:52.530 --> 05:54.160
I see.

05:54.600 --> 05:58.760
Thank you for your concern. 
I'm completely better now.

06:00.920 --> 06:02.530
Do you have work left today?

06:02.840 --> 06:04.420
Oh... no.

06:04.420 --> 06:07.050
I actually have the day off.

06:07.490 --> 06:08.540
The day off?

06:09.070 --> 06:13.050
Could it be... Lord Ron, are 
you feeling unwell again?

06:13.050 --> 06:15.070
No, that isn't the case.

06:15.070 --> 06:15.920
Then, why...

06:16.440 --> 06:18.470
Today, I came to see you.

06:18.920 --> 06:19.730
What?

06:21.090 --> 06:23.430
I had hoped to repay my debt.

06:24.340 --> 06:25.350
Debt?

06:26.210 --> 06:29.520
But I won't be able to rest easy until 
I've repaid the debt I owe you.

06:30.390 --> 06:31.320
Oh.

06:32.620 --> 06:33.630
Come with me.

06:35.890 --> 06:36.910
But...

06:38.930 --> 06:41.520
I believe you said that strawberry 
cake would suffice.

06:42.000 --> 06:47.210
Mango pudding. Banana tart. 
I'll buy you anything you like.

06:51.460 --> 06:52.510
We're leaving.

06:52.510 --> 06:53.630
Yes, Your...

06:54.760 --> 06:56.230
You have a guest?

06:56.230 --> 06:57.370
Yes.

06:57.370 --> 07:00.590
I'd like to go to the most
reputable cafe in Laurage.

07:01.360 --> 07:05.480
In that case, I will take 
you to Cafe Lait, my lord.

07:05.950 --> 07:06.790
Good.

07:07.300 --> 07:09.480
What? Cafe Lait?

07:17.410 --> 07:20.290
<i>Lord Ron isn't the sort of 
person to talk very much,</i>

07:20.290 --> 07:22.910
<i>and I don't have anything in 
particular to talk about,</i>

07:22.910 --> 07:25.240
<i>so I knew that things would turn 
out this way, but still...</i>

07:32.270 --> 07:35.470
<i>From this close, his features 
look even more beautiful.</i>

07:35.470 --> 07:38.310
<i>But it's rude to stare, isn't it?</i>

07:39.840 --> 07:42.580
<i>It's so strange. This atmosphere, it...</i>

07:45.450 --> 07:47.930
<i>It feels familiar to me.</i>

07:54.020 --> 07:55.540
Thank you for waiting.

08:00.530 --> 08:04.090
This is Cafe Lait's special 
strawberry afternoon tea.

08:04.880 --> 08:07.130
Please, take your time and enjoy.

08:09.160 --> 08:11.580
Just one would have been enough.

08:12.020 --> 08:14.610
Despite my appearance, 
I have considerable assets.

08:14.610 --> 08:16.230
No need to refrain. Please, eat.

08:19.110 --> 08:20.180
Oh, Lord Ron!

08:21.430 --> 08:22.440
What is it?

08:22.440 --> 08:25.170
It's nothing.

08:25.980 --> 08:28.830
<i>Lord Ron meant that as a joke, didn't he?</i>

08:29.860 --> 08:34.110
<i>The cakes here... I've always 
wanted to try them at least once.</i>

08:43.340 --> 08:45.890
<i>She's enjoying the cakes so much.</i>

08:46.850 --> 08:50.400
<i>But these can't be my only presents to her.</i>

08:50.930 --> 08:53.910
<i>I have to find out what else she likes.</i>

08:55.400 --> 08:57.370
<i>Who can I possibly ask?</i>

08:58.230 --> 09:01.330
<i>Ren... won't be any help.</i>

09:01.800 --> 09:04.300
<i>That's right! There's Chris!</i>

09:04.300 --> 09:06.730
<i>I've heard that he's an official 
in the administrative bureau.</i>

09:07.350 --> 09:10.930
<i>But what business can I use to call him in?</i>

09:10.930 --> 09:13.540
<i>I don't generally have any 
interactions with him.</i>

09:13.540 --> 09:17.230
<i>Oh. Perhaps we could have a discussion 
about national administration.</i>

09:18.160 --> 09:20.860
<i>He seems deep in thought about something.</i>

09:23.210 --> 09:27.250
That was truly delicious! 
Thank you so much, Lord Ron!

09:27.440 --> 09:28.640
Was it?

09:28.640 --> 09:30.890
Cafe Lait's strawberry tart...

09:30.890 --> 09:34.030
Out of all the tarts I've eaten, 
 it's the most delicious!

09:34.030 --> 09:36.330
The strawberries had the 
perfect amount of sweetness.

09:36.790 --> 09:38.430
You really do like them, don't you?

09:39.100 --> 09:43.760
Yes! If you ate them, Lord Ron, I'm 
certain they'd satisfy your tastes.

09:44.590 --> 09:48.280
Being able to see that face of 
yours satisfies me well enough.

09:48.600 --> 09:49.260
What?

09:51.400 --> 09:52.260
What is it?

09:52.640 --> 09:54.510
I-It's nothing.

09:54.990 --> 09:58.070
<i>It's gratitude. He treated me out of gratitude.</i>

09:58.070 --> 09:59.630
<i>There's no deeper meaning.</i>

10:04.300 --> 10:07.540
<i>This play. I remember it 
became the talk of the town.</i>

10:11.020 --> 10:12.890
Do you want to see this play?

10:13.540 --> 10:15.790
N-No, it's all right.

10:16.510 --> 10:18.390
Let's see it, then.

10:18.390 --> 10:19.350
What?

10:19.350 --> 10:21.630
I-It's really all right!

10:22.010 --> 10:25.140
There's no need to force yourself 
to see it for my sake.

10:25.920 --> 10:30.170
<i>Watching a romantic
play with a man is just...</i>

10:31.000 --> 10:33.190
I want to see this play, too.

10:33.740 --> 10:35.580
Really?

10:36.020 --> 10:39.060
To be precise, I want to watch it with you.

10:39.540 --> 10:40.460
What?

10:42.170 --> 10:43.580
Two tickets, please.

10:42.510 --> 10:44.200
<i>With me?</i>

10:44.200 --> 10:45.570
<i>But why?</i>

10:46.650 --> 10:50.820
<i>Lord Ron and I have only ever 
seen each other at the hospital.</i>

10:53.170 --> 10:55.930
Fortunately, they still had seats available.

10:57.470 --> 11:00.750
Could it be that you dislike the 
idea of watching a play with me?

11:01.160 --> 11:03.640
N-No, it isn't that!

11:04.010 --> 11:05.280
I'm glad to hear it.

11:06.350 --> 11:08.510
Then, let's go inside.

11:09.910 --> 11:11.360
<i>There it is again.</i>

11:11.360 --> 11:13.390
<i>What is this feeling?</i>

11:14.020 --> 11:17.930
Lady Elise, will you dance with me?

11:19.800 --> 11:21.440
<i>Do they remind me of each other?</i>

11:40.780 --> 11:43.070
Rather than ever letting
 go of your hand, I'd...

11:43.500 --> 11:46.020
You mustn't say any more.

11:46.420 --> 11:48.810
At least we have this moment.

12:03.600 --> 12:05.370
Now, all together!

12:06.970 --> 12:09.770
<i>Her expressions change so quickly.</i>

12:09.770 --> 12:10.920
<i>It's so strange.</i>

12:11.670 --> 12:14.980
<i>Just being with Elise sets my heart at ease.</i>

12:15.950 --> 12:19.540
<i>I haven't felt this way since that day.</i>

12:36.880 --> 12:39.450
Don't make her suffer any more!

12:39.450 --> 12:40.610
Silence!

12:55.530 --> 12:58.230
Incredible! How innovative!

12:58.230 --> 13:00.280
This performance makes quite the impact!

13:00.840 --> 13:02.710
This has gone too far to be part of the play.

13:02.710 --> 13:04.890
Yes, something isn't right!

13:07.750 --> 13:08.710
Run!

13:12.450 --> 13:13.320
This is...

13:14.320 --> 13:15.310
Lord Ron!

13:15.650 --> 13:19.410
If you breath in the smoke, you may 
get carbon monoxide poisoning.

13:19.410 --> 13:23.100
Please use this to cover your 
mouth and stay as low as you can.

13:23.650 --> 13:25.000
All right.

13:25.000 --> 13:27.040
But you should use that.

13:27.040 --> 13:28.390
I'll use my own.

13:30.010 --> 13:32.060
What's going on here?

13:32.490 --> 13:35.580
Try not to breathe in the smoke! 
Please stay as low as you can!

13:37.150 --> 13:38.830
Someone explain!

13:39.170 --> 13:40.750
We're all in danger!

13:40.750 --> 13:44.080
Please cover your mouths with a 
handkerchief, stay low, and come this way!

13:44.080 --> 13:48.430
Who are you to give me orders?

13:48.430 --> 13:51.540
And making us behave in 
such an unbecoming manner!

13:52.500 --> 13:57.340
This smoke may contain harmful 
substances! So, please—

13:57.340 --> 13:58.530
Silence!

13:58.530 --> 14:00.650
I'm not taking direction 
from the likes of you!

14:00.650 --> 14:03.770
If the fire started downstairs, 
then it isn't likely to reach this far.

14:03.770 --> 14:05.870
We need only wait for rescue!

14:05.870 --> 14:08.640
Don't say that! We need 
to escape immediately!

14:08.640 --> 14:11.330
Hey! Where has my valet gone?

14:11.330 --> 14:13.330
He's completely neglecting his duties!

14:19.310 --> 14:22.090
Lord Ron, it's dangerous! 
Please keep your head down!

14:22.090 --> 14:23.920
And who are you?

14:23.920 --> 14:25.830
Don't you know who we are?

14:26.750 --> 14:30.340
Is this how honorable nobles 
of the empire behave?

14:32.750 --> 14:37.320
<i>He hasn't even raised his voice, 
but it resonates deep into my body.</i>

14:37.870 --> 14:40.600
<i>I can't help but feel struck with awe.</i>

14:40.600 --> 14:43.320
<i>He has the air of the imperial family.</i>

14:43.830 --> 14:46.990
This theater was built during the 
reign of the previous emperor.

14:47.730 --> 14:49.640
With such dry building materials,

14:49.640 --> 14:53.310
flames of such intensity will reach 
here without a moment's delay.

14:53.310 --> 14:55.440
Then, what should we do?

14:55.440 --> 14:58.680
If you want to leave here alive, 
then don't breathe the smoke.

14:59.490 --> 15:00.590
That's right, isn't it?

15:00.590 --> 15:01.530
Rose?

15:01.530 --> 15:02.820
Y-Yes, it is!

15:02.820 --> 15:07.190
As nobles of the empire, your lives should 
be given for the sake of the nation...

15:07.190 --> 15:09.070
or for noblesse oblige.

15:10.060 --> 15:12.720
Right now, make surviving 
your utmost priority.

15:13.140 --> 15:14.240
Sir!

15:14.240 --> 15:15.730
As you command.

15:16.930 --> 15:19.230
The flames are burning near the stage.

15:19.530 --> 15:23.170
Those stairs up ahead head in the 
opposite direction from the stage.

15:23.900 --> 15:25.470
We should be able to evacuate that way.

15:28.770 --> 15:31.720
Follow me! Make sure you 
don't get separated!

15:31.720 --> 15:32.740
Let's go.

15:37.340 --> 15:40.260
Don't worry. I swear that 
I will protect all of you.

15:40.910 --> 15:41.940
Yes, sir!

15:46.490 --> 15:48.190
One at a time! Don't rush!

15:54.820 --> 15:56.520
It's only a makeshift treatment.

15:56.520 --> 15:58.270
Th-Thank you.

15:58.270 --> 16:00.090
It's only a little farther. Let's go.

16:02.020 --> 16:03.680
We're the only ones left.

16:03.680 --> 16:04.920
Rose, you go first.

16:05.450 --> 16:06.460
All right.

16:10.810 --> 16:11.770
Rose!

16:19.950 --> 16:21.810
Rose, are you all right?

16:22.300 --> 16:24.830
Yes, but the stairs are...

16:25.200 --> 16:26.850
Let's look for another route.

16:35.690 --> 16:36.850
Children?

16:37.290 --> 16:40.230
I'll go and have a look. You should—

16:40.540 --> 16:41.470
Rose!

16:47.120 --> 16:48.490
Let's go!

16:51.200 --> 16:54.050
You seem to have a patent on recklessness.

16:58.040 --> 16:59.220
Let's go.

17:03.820 --> 17:05.860
There's a passage like 
this in the basement?

17:08.230 --> 17:11.530
It seems the smoke hasn't reached here yet.

17:14.020 --> 17:15.330
Big brother!

17:15.330 --> 17:17.000
Don't cry! Hurry up and go!

17:17.340 --> 17:19.570
Are you all right? We'll help you!

17:20.940 --> 17:24.170
I'm fine. Please save my little sister!

17:24.170 --> 17:27.440
There's a loading entrance 
that way. You have to hurry!

17:27.440 --> 17:30.730
No! I'm staying with you, big brother!

17:30.730 --> 17:32.980
Rose, take the child and go!

17:33.350 --> 17:34.610
What about you, Lord Ron?

17:34.610 --> 17:37.270
I'll help this child and follow after.

17:37.270 --> 17:38.110
Hurry!

17:38.110 --> 17:39.360
But!

17:39.730 --> 17:41.920
If you can save even one more life...

17:42.380 --> 17:44.520
That's your creed, isn't it?

17:47.130 --> 17:49.600
As someone who stands above others,

17:49.600 --> 17:52.130
it is my duty to protect 
the lives of the people.

17:52.610 --> 17:56.150
And if there is a life I can save, 
then I will do everything I can.

17:56.150 --> 17:58.000
The one who taught me that...

17:58.000 --> 17:59.110
was you.

18:03.790 --> 18:08.270
Please... you must make sure to follow after us!

18:08.590 --> 18:11.780
I will. Please get everything ready 
to treat him and wait for us.

18:17.280 --> 18:19.030
Big brother!

18:19.330 --> 18:22.390
It's all right! I'm certain 
that Lord Ron will save him!

18:36.010 --> 18:37.050
Your hair!

18:38.230 --> 18:40.810
<i>So, I've reached the limits 
of my disguise ability.</i>

18:42.070 --> 18:45.670
Don't let it concern you. Right 
now, just focus on getting saved.

19:01.740 --> 19:05.350
Thanks to you, we managed 
to narrowly escape death.

19:05.350 --> 19:07.820
How can we possibly thank you?

19:08.540 --> 19:13.280
No, what saved you was your 
own decisive judgment.

19:13.670 --> 19:15.090
It's coming down!

19:15.730 --> 19:18.080
It's dangerous! Stay back!

19:18.360 --> 19:19.440
Lord Ron...

19:19.910 --> 19:22.600
Hey! Someone call a doctor over here!

19:22.600 --> 19:25.120
We have someone who got 
out through the basement!

19:26.340 --> 19:27.660
Lord Ron!

19:28.390 --> 19:29.380
Rose!

19:35.710 --> 19:38.690
I was so worried!

19:51.570 --> 19:53.880
Are you hurt? I'll treat you right away!

19:54.260 --> 19:56.960
I'm all right. So is the boy.

19:58.890 --> 20:00.200
Big brother!

20:00.200 --> 20:01.800
Don't cry!

20:02.860 --> 20:06.640
I'm so glad. It seems everyone 
made it out safely.

20:07.540 --> 20:08.690
I see.

20:11.370 --> 20:13.000
Chris?

20:15.980 --> 20:18.900
If you have family here, then 
you should go home together.

20:20.910 --> 20:21.910
Lord Ron?

20:26.260 --> 20:27.110
What?

20:31.010 --> 20:32.420
Lise!

20:38.170 --> 20:39.170
I'm sorry, Lise!

20:39.600 --> 20:44.930
I told you that you should go out, and then 
you got caught up in something awful!

20:46.060 --> 20:49.160
Please don't apologize, Chris.

20:49.160 --> 20:52.340
It was an accident. It couldn't be helped.

20:52.340 --> 20:54.190
Yes, but...

20:54.920 --> 20:57.830
It was your precious day off, Lise!

20:58.630 --> 21:00.540
Chris...

21:06.070 --> 21:08.220
<i>What we faced was horrible.</i>

21:09.480 --> 21:11.940
<i>I'm so glad everyone was safe.</i>

21:12.450 --> 21:13.810
<i>Lord Ron, too.</i>

21:30.490 --> 21:33.430
I won't be able to use this for a while.

21:34.550 --> 21:36.170
But I'm glad.

21:37.790 --> 21:39.980
The appearance this gives me is a lie.

21:41.080 --> 21:44.550
<i>In that false guise, I cannot 
be allowed to touch her.</i>

21:47.940 --> 21:52.790
<i>Elise has grown to be such a 
tremendous presence within me.</i>

21:54.630 --> 21:55.790
<i>But...</i>

21:56.700 --> 22:00.510
<i>She... will never smile at me.</i>

22:06.220 --> 22:09.930
For a Brief While
